4. Veeza AI (Privacy-First Visa Agent)

Solves one problem: Automates tedious visa applications without exposing sensitive passport data to the cloud.

Target customers: Frequent international travelers.

Infrastructure: Local-hosted LLMs, OCR, and form automation.

Reimagines space: Makes visa automation secure by processing sensitive data entirely on local hardware rather than cloud bots.

LLM Core: Local LLM reads OCR data from passports to perfectly map information to complex government forms.

Validation Guardrail: Regex and schema validators ensure passport numbers and dates strictly match official required formats.

Self-Correction: If a date format is invalid, the system automatically prompts the LLM to re-parse the OCR text in the correct format.

Deployability: Deployable as a secure, local desktop application.
